# <type>(<scope>): <subject>  (72 chars max on this line)
#
# Types: feat fix refactor chore docs test build ci perf style revert
# Scopes (suggested): audit, rules, autofill, popup, options, widget,
#                     review, build, release, docs
#
# Body (optional): what and WHY, wrapped at 72 chars. The diff shows how.
#
# Examples:
#   feat(audit): downgrade duplicates when laterality wording present
#   fix(autofill): anchor hidden-cell offsets to approved input
#   chore(build): add options page to the packaged file list
